    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ramp Up, Time sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Every round of combat you are affected by one of your alter time effects, all of your movement speeds are increased by 5 feet. This bonus stacks with itself and ends at the end of combat.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
